hidden scores.</strong> Beyond defeating enemies, chests and hidden scores await exploration in the scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move: W, A, S, D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim &amp; Attack: Mouse Button1, Mouse Button2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue: C</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Interaction: Q</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause &amp; Settings: ESC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Tips</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 You cannot move until your attack animation finishes; monsters are similarly bound. Use attack intervals to find openings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Some projectiles penetrate obstacles; others do not. Using cover is a viable survival tactic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Talk to NPCs to learn about the game world's lore and potentially gain clues to overcome challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 If you notice any [anomaly] in the scene, or your attack feedback appears where it shouldn't, try pressing Q or continue attacking that spot. You might gain the Elf's power or uncover hidden scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Observe the overall screen to better dodge dangerous attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 You can select \u201cPlay Again\u201d in the pause menu (ESC) to restart the current level. Save your progress <i><strong>after each Level</strong> </i>- <strong>through <i>a magic book</i></strong>\u00a0 - if you want.\u00a0\u00a0</p>",
